<http://data.silknow.org/object/b01ae6df-acfd-3f4e-8464-ab0a0778923c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Very small doll, head & torso possibly painted wood but too small to tell, could be stuffed cloth. Painted face. Turquoise seed bead necklace. Strands of blonde human hair attached to head, small blue silk cap. Wearing dress of ivory & pink silk damask with cuffs of narrow silver braid, hem also edged with silver braid. Cloth arms. Gauze apron edged with narrow lace. No legs."@en , "Miniature doll in silk, silver braid and gauze dress"@en , "Unique"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/834979c1-9540-3a22-a41c-d968f57ab5ab> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/03d51db8-b439-31b1-ae75-1b8d7b478eef> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Very small doll, head & torso possibly painted wood but too small to tell, could be stuffed cloth. Painted face. Turquoise seed bead necklace. Strands of blonde human hair attached to head, small blue silk cap. Wearing dress of ivory & pink silk damask with cuffs of narrow silver braid, hem also edged with silver braid. Cloth arms. Gauze apron edged with narrow lace. No legs."@en , "Unique"@en , "Miniature doll in silk, silver braid and gauze dress"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/b01ae6df-acfd-3f4e-8464-ab0a0778923c/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b01ae6df-acfd-3f4e-8464-ab0a0778923c/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/b01ae6df-acfd-3f4e-8464-ab0a0778923c/dimension/1> ;
